# Async / Await

- Never call `.Result` or `.Wait()` on a Task — causes deadlocks
- All I/O-bound methods must be `async`
- Use `ConfigureAwait(false)` in library code
- Always accept and forward `CancellationToken`:

```csharp
// ✅ GOOD
public async Task<User> GetUserAsync(int id, CancellationToken ct = default)
{
    return await _repo.FindAsync(id, ct).ConfigureAwait(false);
}
```

- Avoid `async void` — only allowed for event handlers
